            <title><![CDATA[Native Model Authoring for Edge with LiteRT Tensor API]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Meet the LiteRT Tensor API: giving developers native C++ control over the model graph to unify end-to-end ML computations on heterogeneous edge hardware.]]></description>
            <link>https://developers.googleblog.com/native-model-authoring-for-edge-with-litert-tensor-api/</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://developers.googleblog.com/native-model-authoring-for-edge-with-litert-tensor-api/</guid>
